  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IFC Economic Resilience Action (ERA) Programme for Ukraine</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Economic Resilience Action (ERA) will provide a framework for IFC to address the private sector financing needs during 
Russia&apos;s invasion of Ukraine and prepare for the reconstruction phase. IFC blends own funds with contribution from donors such as Norway as levers to reduce investment risk, thereby enabling more investments to critically important sectors of Ukaine&apos;s economy. NOK 50 million are earmarked to renewable energy projects in the Ukraine.</narrative>
  </description>
